. Remote web push still requires a configured push provider/service worker; in-app alerts work without it.</p></div></main><script>browser.onclick=async()=>{if(!('Notification'in window))return alert('Browser notifications are not supported.');let p=await Notification.requestPermission();alert('Notification permission: '+p)}</script><?php sk1100_render_ai_widget('public');?> </body></html>